The `WriteClassName` feature and the error message indicate that the key handling logic does not correctly manage the key types when processing JSON tokens. This requires adjusting the part of the code where keys are being parsed and placed into the map to ensure that all keys are handled as Strings when `WriteClassName` or similar features are in effect.

